# Local secrets for the Cloudflare Worker (used by `wrangler dev`).
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in real values.
# `.dev.vars` is ignored by Git and must never be committed or shared.
# In production these values are stored with `wrangler secret put`.

# Travelpayouts → Profile → API token
TRAVELPAYOUTS_TOKEN=paste-your-token-here
